# Power BI Dashboard Explanation

The Power BI dashboard was developed to visualize retail business insights interactively.

## Dashboard Features

### KPI Cards
- Total Revenue
- Total Orders
- Total Customers
- Total Quantity
- Average Order Value

### Charts Used
- Revenue by Country (Bar Chart)
- Monthly Sales Trend (Line Chart)
- Top Product Contribution (Donut Chart)

### Filters
Interactive slicers were used for:
- Month
- Country
- Product Description
- Customer

### Insights Generated
- Identified top-performing countries
- Analyzed monthly sales trends
- Found highest revenue-generating products
- Tracked customer purchasing behavior

---

# Business Impact

The dashboard helps business users:
- Monitor sales performance
- Improve inventory management
- Understand customer behavior
- Make data-driven business decisions